===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|race}}, from {{cog|ang|rǣs|t=a race, swift or violent running, rush, onset}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*rēsō|t=a course}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*reh₁s-|t=to flow, rush}}. Cognate with {{der|en|non|rás|t=a running, race}}, {{cog|gml|râs|t=a strong current}}, {{cog|nl|ras|t=a strong whirling current}}. Compare {{cog|da|ræs}}, {{cog|no|-}} and {{cog|sv|ras}}, {{cog|no|rås}}.

