##* {{quote-book|en|year=1911| author={{w|Robert W. Service}}| chapter=The Men That Don't Fit In| title=The Spell of the Yukon| passage=There's a '''race''' of men that don't fit in, / A '''race''' that can't stay still; / So they break the hearts of kith and kin, / And they roam the world at will.}}
